  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 5 year rows (昭和8-12, bare numerals expanded to '昭和 N'; '年末' printed above); 地方別 總數(內地) row + 47 prefectures + 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 關東州及滿鐵附屬地, 南洋 = 53 rows. Table title and chapter heading '11. 警察、衞生及災害' printed at top of the page.",
   "Footnote marks kept as printed: (1) before 朝鮮/臺灣/樺太 and (2) before 南洋 are placed after the label; (3)9,947 (臺灣 巡査), (4)3,401 (關東州 巡査), (5)6 (南洋 警察署), (6)144 (南洋 巡査) kept inside the cells. '…' printed for 朝鮮 巡査部長 and 關東州及滿鐵附屬地 巡査部長 (nil/not stated).",
   "Last column heading is printed in small rotated type, read as 巡査一人ニ付人口.",
   "地方別: the 47 prefecture rows add up exactly to the printed 總數(內地) row in all 11 columns (1,222; 5,252; 14,218; 17; 69,852; 52; 412; 1,675; 4,021; 8,335; 55,357); the last column (persons per patrolman) is a ratio, not summed.",
   "職員 總數 equals the sum of the six staff columns in all rows except: 昭和11 (printed 66,852; the six columns sum to 66,528, diff 324 — cells re-read, left as printed) and 關東州及滿鐵附屬地 (printed 3,643; 16+49+127+3,401 = 3,593, diff 50 — re-read on enlarged crop, left as printed). 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 南洋 reconcile (the cells marked '…' counted as nil).",
   "昭和10 巡査駐在所及巡査立番所 printed 12,240 (neighbours 14,115-14,242), kept as printed. 茨城 last column printed '1 640' with comma blurred, read 1,640."
  ],
